# Jenkins Automated Deployment from Gitea to App Server 1

## Project Overview

This task configures Jenkins to retrieve application source code from a Gitea repository and deploy it automatically to App Server 1 (`stapp01`).

The Jenkins job is named:

`datacenter-app-deployment`

The deployment retrieves the `master` branch from Gitea and publishes the repository contents to Apache's document root.

