## 6. Conclusion

The Jenkins deployment pipeline was configured and tested successfully.

Jenkins retrieves the application from Gitea, transfers the repository contents to App Server 1, applies the required ownership, and restarts Apache.

Two successful Jenkins builds and a successful HTTP 200 response from the load balancer demonstrate that the deployment is functioning and repeatable.

**Trigger qualification:** The implemented automatic trigger uses Jenkins Poll SCM rather than a Gitea webhook. Repository changes are checked approximately every two minutes.
